      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i know it sounds crazy but i've seen it happen too many times. even when the wifi is totally fine. if i can't get professional equipment to check the frequencies, what should i be looking for in my local network traffic or router logs that would show this kind of 'heartbeat' or burst pattern? like what would the signature of data being exfiltrated through a light pulse or a dimmer look like? i'm really worried they're scraping everything i say.",
